[0.145253, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1mtoolInterfacer\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  ·  one intent in, one answer out, plus the receipt\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n  service   http://127.0.0.1:39541   (9 ops registered)\r\n  deciding  choice  \u001b[36mfixture       \u001b[0m\u001b[2mrecorded answers — deterministic, offline\u001b[0m\r\n            noul    \u001b[36mfixture       \u001b[0m\u001b[2mrecorded answers — deterministic, offline\u001b[0m\r\n            extract \u001b[36mrule_extract  \u001b[0m\u001b[2mkeyword rules — no model\u001b[0m\r\n  tools     \u001b[2mthe repo fixtures (tests/data/fake_cli.py) — deterministic\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  files     /tmp/ti-demo-files-2zdtaq50\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  note: --live swaps the configured backend in for every decision above,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m        and the real web CLIs in for the fixtures.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.146694, "o", "\u001b[1mscene 1 — the caller names the operation\u001b[0m\r\n  intent  \u001b[36m'read notes.md'\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m          L0 passthrough — no decision is made, so there is nothing to reason about\u001b[0m\r\n"]
