[8.455423, "o", "  \u001b[2mstep            op                       ms   conf  artifact\u001b[0m\r\n  queries         decide_extract          0.2\u001b[2m      —\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mvalue_list[6] e.g. research lora r\u001b[0m\r\n  hits            web_search            152.7\u001b[32m   1.00\u001b[0m  \u001b[2murl_list[7] e.g. {'title': 'A frag\u001b[0m\r\n  picked          decide_pick             0.3\u001b[32m   0.93\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mpicked_items[4] e.g. https://examp\u001b[0m\r\n  pages#0         web_fetch              30.6\u001b[32m   1.00\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mpages[1] e.g. {'url': 'https://exa\u001b[0m\r\n  pages#1         web_fetch              24.0\u001b[32m   1.00\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mpages[1] e.g. {'url': 'https://oth\u001b[0m\r\n  pages#2         web_fetch              26.9\u001b[32m   1.00\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mpages[1] e.g. {'url': 'https://oth\u001b[0m\r\n  pages#3         web_fetch              26.1\u001b[32m   1.00\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mpages[1] e.g. {'url': 'https://oth\u001b[0m\r\n  digest          digest_assemble         0.1\u001b[32m   1.00\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mdigest :: {'intent': 'research lor\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  status \u001b[32mdone\u001b[0m   confidence 0.93   \u001b[1m8\u001b[0m hops in 264 ms wall\r\n"]
[9.456639, "o", "  result 4 source(s) · queries: research lora rank, research lora, research · first: https://example.test/a#frag\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m  the whole point: \u001b[0mthe caller made one call per scene, and got every hop above as evidence.\r\n\u001b[2m  A normal agent makes one model round trip per tool call. Here the number\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  of hops and the number of round trips are decoupled — which helps when a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  round trip is expensive and hurts when the local decision is. Measured:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  docs/roundtrips-2026-11-03.md.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
